Notebook[{Cell["VVMFTool v2 PlayGround", "Title"], 
  Cell["This notebook reproduces the v1 PlayGround \
(VVMFTool-Calculation/PlayGround.nb) with VVMFToolv2. Every v1 step is shown \
with its v2 counterpart; where v2 behaves differently, the text says why. \
Irreps are referred to by their index in the group, as in v1, and every \
result is verified exactly.", "Text"], Cell["Load the package", "Section"], 
  Cell["Load VVMFToolv2 through the link VVMFToolv2 next to this notebook (it \
points to 25.03.00.General/software/VVMFToolv2). Loading does not start GAP."\
, "Text"], Cell["$VVMFToolV2Root = FileNameJoin[{NotebookDirectory[], \
\"VVMFToolv2\"}];\nGet[FileNameJoin[{$VVMFToolV2Root, \"Kernel\", \
\"init.m\"}]]", "Input", CellLabel -> "In[1]:="], 
  Cell[BoxData["True"], "Output", CellLabel -> "Out[1]="], 
  Cell["The GAP executable is found automatically. To set it explicitly (v1: \
$GAPPATH), use ConfigureVVMFTool; CheckGAP reports the GAP installation and \
its packages.", "Text"], Cell["ConfigureVVMFTool[GAPExecutable -> \
\"/opt/homebrew/bin/gap\"];\nCheckGAP[][\"Version\"]", "Input", 
   CellLabel -> "In[2]:="], Cell[BoxData["\"4.15.1\""], "Output", 
   CellLabel -> "Out[2]="], Cell["Build the group", "Section"], 
  Cell["Example groups", "Subsection"], Cell["The modular groups of table 2 \
of arXiv:2112.14761 are built by their label (v1: GroupRelationData and \
GroupBuilder). BuildModularGroup checks that S and T satisfy the modular \
relations (S^2 central, (ST)^3 = S^4) and generate the whole group, and \
computes every irreducible representation. Basis -> \"UnitaryTDiagonal\" asks \
directly for unitary matrices with diagonal T (v1: GetUnitaryRep and \
DiagWrtT). The output names the group by its label.", "Text"], 
  Cell["GroupTp = BuildModularGroup[\"24-3I\", Basis -> \
\"UnitaryTDiagonal\"]", "Input", CellLabel -> "In[3]:="], 
  Cell[BoxData[InterpretationBox[
     TagBox[TooltipBox[TemplateBox[{"\"Group[\"", StyleBox["\"24-3I\"", Bold, 
          StripOnInput -> False], "\"]\""}, "RowDefault"], 
       TagBox[GridBox[{{"\"24-3I\""}, {"\"order 24, GAP ID {24, 3}\""}, 
          {"\"7 irreps\""}, {"\"modular S, T assigned\""}, 
          {"\"group-241b54dc-f5f0-48d9-8c29-0cf109e6af4e\""}}, 
         GridBoxAlignment -> {"Columns" -> {{Left}}}, DefaultBaseStyle -> 
          "Column", GridBoxItemSize -> {"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, 
           "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}], "Column"]], 
      Annotation[#1, Column[{"24-3I", "order 24, GAP ID {24, 3}", "7 irreps", 
          "modular S, T assigned", 
          "group-241b54dc-f5f0-48d9-8c29-0cf109e6af4e"}], "Tooltip"] & ], 
     Group["group-241b54dc-f5f0-48d9-8c29-0cf109e6af4e"]]], "Output", 
   CellLabel -> "Out[3]="], 
  Cell[
   "Group2T = BuildModularGroup[\"24-3II\", Basis -> \"UnitaryTDiagonal\"]", 
