, "Output", CellLabel -> "Out[28]="], Cell["Clebsch-Gordan coefficients", 
   "Section"], Cell["A representation-valued vector (v1: RepVec) is made with \
MakeRepVector, with explicit components.", "Text"], 
  Cell["va = MakeRepVector[GroupTp, 4, {a[1], a[2]}];\nvb = \
MakeRepVector[GroupTp, 7, {b[1], b[2], b[3]}];", "Input", 
   CellLabel -> "In[29]:="], Cell["TensorProductVectors multiplies vectors \
through verified CG coefficients (v1: ProductCG). Every channel of the \
product is a record with its target irrep and components:", "Text"], 
  Cell["{#[\"TargetLabel\"], Simplify[#[\"Components\"]]} & /@ \
VectorComponents[TensorProductVectors[GroupTp, {va, vb}]] // Column", 
   "Input", CellLabel -> "In[30]:="], 
  Cell[BoxData[TagBox[GridBox[
      {{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"\"2''\"", ",", RowBox[
             {"{", RowBox[{FractionBox[RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", RowBox[
                        {"a", "[", "1", "]"}]}], " ", RowBox[{"b", "[", "1", 
                       "]"}]}], "+", RowBox[{SqrtBox["2"], " ", RowBox[
                      {"a", "[", "2", "]"}], " ", RowBox[{"b", "[", "3", 
                       "]"}]}]}], SqrtBox["3"]], ",", FractionBox[
                 RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"a", "[", "2", "]"}], " ", 
                     RowBox[{"b", "[", "1", "]"}]}], "+", RowBox[
                    {SqrtBox["2"], " ", RowBox[{"a", "[", "1", "]"}], " ", 
                     RowBox[{"b", "[", "2", "]"}]}]}], SqrtBox["3"]]}], 
              "}"}]}], "}"}]}, 
       {RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"\"2'\"", ",", RowBox[
             {"{", RowBox[{FractionBox[RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"a", "[", "2", 
                       "]"}], " ", RowBox[{"b", "[", "2", "]"}]}], "+", 
                   RowBox[{SqrtBox["2"], " ", RowBox[{"a", "[", "1", "]"}], 
                     " ", RowBox[{"b", "[", "3", "]"}]}]}], SqrtBox["3"]], 
                ",", FractionBox[RowBox[{RowBox[{SqrtBox["2"], " ", 
                     RowBox[{"a", "[", "2", "]"}], " ", RowBox[{"b", "[", 
                       "1", "]"}]}], "-", RowBox[{RowBox[{"a", "[", "1", 
                       "]"}], " ", RowBox[{"b", "[", "2", "]"}]}]}], 
                 SqrtBox["3"]]}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}, 
       {RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"\"2\"", ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{FractionBox[
                 RowBox[{RowBox[{SqrtBox["2"], " ", RowBox[{"a", "[", "1", 
                       "]"}], " ", RowBox[{"b", "[", "1", "]"}]}], "+", 
                   RowBox[{RowBox[{"a", "[", "2", "]"}], " ", RowBox[
                      {"b", "[", "3", "]"}]}]}], SqrtBox["3"]], ",", 
                FractionBox[RowBox[{RowBox[{SqrtBox["2"], " ", RowBox[
                      {"a", "[", "2", "]"}], " ", RowBox[{"b", "[", "2", 
                       "]"}]}], "-", RowBox[{RowBox[{"a", "[", "1", "]"}], 
                     " ", RowBox[{"b", "[", "3", "]"}]}]}], SqrtBox["3"]]}], 
              "}"}]}], "}"}]}}, GridBoxAlignment -> {"Columns" -> {{Left}}}, 
      DefaultBaseStyle -> "Column", GridBoxItemSize -> 
       {"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}], "Column"]], 
   "Output", CellLabel -> "Out[30]="], Cell["One target only, as polynomials \
of given component lists (v1: ProductCGReduced):", "Text"], 
  Cell["VectorComponents[CGPolynomialResult[GroupTp, {4, 7}, 4, \
ComponentLists -> {{a1, a2}, {b1, b2, b3}}]][[All, \"Components\"]] // \
Simplify", "Input", CellLabel -> "In[31]:="], 
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[
     {"{", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{FractionBox[RowBox[
            {RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", "a1"}], " ", "b1"}], "+", 
             RowBox[{SqrtBox["2"], " ", "a2", " ", "b3"}]}], SqrtBox["3"]], 
          ",", FractionBox[RowBox[{RowBox[{"a2", " ", "b1"}], "+", 
             RowBox[{SqrtBox["2"], " ", "a1", " ", "b2"}]}], SqrtBox["3"]]}], 
        "}"}], "}"}]], "Output", CellLabel -> "Out[31]="], 
  Cell["Repeated targets keep every copy (v1's ProductCGReduced lost the \
second copy). In GroupT7, 5 \\[CircleTimes] 5 contains 4 twice. For equal \
factors v2 chooses the two copies symmetric and antisymmetric under exchange, \
so they are the sum and difference of v1's two copies {a2 b3, a1 b2, a3 b1} \
and {a3 b2, a2 b1, a1 b3} (up to normalization and ordering):", "Text"], 
  Cell["VectorComponents[CGPolynomialResult[GroupT7, {5, 5}, 4, \
ComponentLists -> {{a1, a2, a3}, {b1, b2, b3}}]][[All, \"Components\"]]", 
