   "Output", CellLabel -> "Out[17]="], Cell["Symmetric matrices (v1: \
MakeMassMatrixSym) come from ExtractQuadraticMatrix.", "Text"], 
  Cell["With modular weights", "Subsection"], Cell["A modular model gives \
each field a weight label k_f (actual weight -k_f) and fixes the weight k_W \
of the superpotential (default 0; v1: $SuperpotentialWeight). Weights are \
exact rationals; as in v1 the fields get u: 1/2, u3: 3/2, Q: 1/2, so u Q \
needs a form of weight 1 and u3 Q one of weight 2. A product that would need \
a form of non-integer weight gets none for T' (an SL(2,Z) quotient admits \
integer weights only: rho(S^2) = e^{i Pi k}).", "Text"], 
  Cell["ctx = RepresentationContext[GroupTp];\nuW = CreateField[ctx, 4, \
\"u\"]; u3W = CreateField[ctx, 1, \"u3\"]; QW = CreateField[ctx, 7, \
\"Q\"];\nmW = CreateModularModel[ctx, {uW, u3W, QW}, FieldWeights -> \
<|uW[\"ID\"] -> 1/2, u3W[\"ID\"] -> 3/2, QW[\"ID\"] -> 1/2|>];", "Input", 
   CellLabel -> "In[18]:="], Cell["The modular forms that can complete each \
product into the superpotential (v1: GetOneViaModularFormList): one slot per \
independent form, listed as {irrep, weight, copy}.", "Text"], 
  Cell["Table[With[{cand = ModularFormCandidates[mW, p]}, {#[\"Name\"] & /@ \
p, cand[\"Complete\"], {IrrepIndex[GroupTp, #[\"IrrepID\"]], #[\"Weight\"], \
#[\"Copy\"]} & /@ cand[\"Slots\"]}], {p, {{uW, QW}, {u3W, QW}}}]", "Input", 
   CellLabel -> "In[19]:="], 
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[
     {"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"\"u\"", ",", 
                "\"Q\""}], "}"}], ",", "True", ",", 
            RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"6", ",", "1", ",", "1"}], 
                "}"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"\"u3\"", ",", "\"Q\""}], 
              "}"}], ",", "True", ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{"7", ",", "2", ",", "1"}], "}"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], 
      "}"}]], "Output", CellLabel -> "Out[19]="], 
  Cell["The Yukawa terms with all possible forms (v1: GetOneViaModularForm), \
then a coupling for each form (v1: AddCoeffToY):", "Text"], 
  Cell["mW = Fold[AddModelTerm[#1, CoupleContractions[ModularContractions[#1, \
#2]]] &, mW, {{uW, QW}, {u3W, QW}}];\nmW = \
AddModularFormCouplings[mW];\nModelView[mW]", "Input", 
   CellLabel -> "In[20]:="], 
